  "label": "Dark Humor About Parental Absence",
  "description": "The meme uses dark humor to juxtapose the innocence of childhood with the grim reality of a missing parent. The phrase 'my dad is the best at hide and seek' is a metaphor for a father who has been absent for 15 years, implying he is 'hidden' or gone. This type of humor relies on the contrast between a child's serious expression and the absurdity of the situation, which can be insensitive and potentially retraumatizing for those who have experienced similar situations.",
